{"unit_id": "tag:02W5:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001><FOOTNOTEOPEN_0001>这里缺少fpqc并非笔误。见拓扑（Topologies），第<REF_0001>节中的讨论。<FOOTNOTECLOSE_0001>。设<MATH_0002>是一个大（big）<MATH_0003>-景（site）。设<MATH_0004>。设<MATH_0005>是景（site）<MATH_0006>中的一个覆盖（covering）。存在一个范畴等价（equivalence of categories）\n<MATHSEG_0001>下降（descent）数据（data）<MATHSEG_0002>使得<MATHSEG_0003>每个<MATHSEG_0004>层（sheaves）<MATHSEG_0005>在<MATHSEG_0006>上，使得<MATHSEG_0007>每个<MATHSEG_0008>是可表示（representable）的<MATHSEG_0009>\n此外，\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002>右侧表示（representing）<MATH_0007>的对象（objects）对应于左侧的概形（schemes）<MATH_0008>，且\n<STRUCT_0003>层（sheaf）<MATH_0009>可表示（representable），当且仅当对应的下降（descent）数据（datum）<MATH_0010>是有效（effective）的。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n", "allowed_english": ["fpqc"], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "Topologies", "target_term": "拓扑"}, {"source_term": "big", "target_term": "大"}, {"source_term": "site", "target_term": "景"}, {"source_term": "site", "target_term": "景"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "equivalence of categories", "target_term": "范畴等价"}, {"source_term": "descent", "target_term": "下降"}, {"source_term": "data", "target_term": "数据"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "representable", "target_term": "可表示"}, {"source_term": "representing", "target_term": "表示"}, {"source_term": "objects", "target_term": "对象"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "representable", "target_term": "可表示"}, {"source_term": "descent", "target_term": "下降"}, {"source_term": "datum", "target_term": "数据"}, {"source_term": "effective", "target_term": "有效"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "Topologies", "target_term": "拓扑", "context": "脚注引用章名。"}, {"source_term": "big", "target_term": "大", "context": "大景的限定。"}, {"source_term": "site", "target_term": "景", "context": "大景及其切片景。"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖", "context": "景中的覆盖。"}, {"source_term": "equivalence of categories