{"unit_id": "tag:02W5:proof", "translation": "我们已在第<REF_0001>节中看到，可表示（representable）预层（presheaves）是景（site）<MATH_0001>上的层（sheaves）。此外，米田引理（Yoneda lemma）（范畴（Categories），引理<REF_0002>）保证，可表示（representable）层（sheaves）之间的映射（maps）与表示（representing）对象（objects）之间的映射（maps）一一对应。在证明中将使用这些说明，不再另行提及。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n下面构造从右到左的函子（functor）。设<MATH_0002>是一个层（sheaf），它在<MATH_0003>上，且每个<MATH_0004>都可表示（representable）。此时，取<MATH_0005>为<MATH_0006>中的一个表示（representing）对象（object）。它配备一个态射（morphism）<MATH_0007>。于是<MATH_0008>和<MATH_0009>都表示（represent）层（sheaf）<MATH_0010>，因而得到一个同构（isomorphism）\n<MATH_0011>\n容易看出，映射（maps）<MATH_0012>是<MATH_0013>上的态射（morphisms），并满足余循环条件（cocycle condition）。从右到左的函子（functor）由这个构造<MATH_0014>给出。\n\n<STRUCT_0003><STRUCT_0004>\n下面构造一个从左到右的函子（functor）。对每个<MATH_0015>，用<MATH_0016>表示层（sheaf）<MATH_0017>。同构（isomorphisms）<MATH_0018>给出同构（isomorphisms）\n<MATH_0019>\n它们在<MATH_0020>之上。令<MATH_0021>等于下图（diagram）中的余等化子（coequalizer）\n<MATH_0022>\n余循环条件（cocycle condition）保证<MATH_0023>同构（isomorphic）于<MATH_0024>，因而可表示（representable）。从左到右的函子（functor）由这个构造<MATH_0025>给出。\n\n<STRUCT_0005><STRUCT_0006>\n我们省略验证这些构造给出互为拟逆（quasi-inverse）的函子（functors）。最后的陈述(1)和(2)由这些构造得出。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "representable", "target_term": "可表示"}, {"source_term": "presheaves", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "site", "target_term": "景"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "Yoneda lemma", "target_term": "米田引理"}, {"source_term": "Categories", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "representable", "target_term": "可表示"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "representing", "target_term": "表示"}, {"source_term": "objects", "target_term": "对象"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "representable", "target_term": "可表示"}, {"source_term": "representing", "target_term": "表示"}, {"source_term": "object", "target_term": "对象"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "represent", "target_term": "表示"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "cocycle condition", "target_term": "余循环条件"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "isomorphisms", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "isomorphisms", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图"}, {"source_term": "coequalizer", "target_term": "余等化子"}, {"source_term": "cocycle condition", "target_term": "余循环条件"}, {"source_term": "isomorphic", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "representable", "target_term": "可表示"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "quasi-inverse", "target_term": "拟逆"}, {"source_term": "functors", "target_term": "函子"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "representable", "target_term": "可表示", "context": "预层、层及局部乘积的可表示性。"}, {"source_term": "presheaves", "target_term": "预层", "context": "由对象表示的预层。"}, {"source_term": "site", "target_term": "景", "context": "给定拓扑的切片景。"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层", "context": "可表示层。"}, {"source_term": "Yoneda lemma", "target_term": "米田引理", "context": "用以对应对象映射与层映射。"}, {"source_term": "Categories", "target_term": "范畴", "context": "引用章名。"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射", "context": "层映射及表示对象的映射。"}, {"source_term": "representing", "target_term": "表示", "context": "对象表示层的关系。"}, {"source_term": "objects", "target_term": "对象", "context": "表示层的对象。"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子", "context": "两个方向的构造。"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "所给、表示或构造的层。"}, {"source_term": "object", "target_term": "对象", 